{%- comment -%}
  The card and wallet logos shoppers in our markets (US, Canada, Australia, NZ) recognise, in a fixed order, instead of
  every method Shopify Payments has switched on (which shows European methods like Bancontact and MB WAY).
  Renders <li> items only; wrap it in your own <ul>. Param: limit (optional).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pay_types = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay' | split: ',' -%}
{%- assign pay_limit = limit | default: 6 -%}
{%- for type in pay_types limit: pay_limit -%}<li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag }}</li>{%- endfor -%}
